mer experience. This is an exciting opportunity to join a fast-paced SaaS environment, influence strategic deals, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW225411383 BCX0&quot;&gt;optimize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW225411383 BCX0&quot;&gt; processes that directly &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW225411383 BCX0&quot;&gt;impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW225411383 BCX0&quot;&gt; company growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW225411383 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
